# Yakuake skin recolor map: Monochrome (Patrik Wyde) -> Gorgoroth.
#
# Format: <old-hex> <new-hex>   # role
# Consumed by:
#   recolor.sh -> hex substitution over the SVGs and, derived from the same
#                 pairs, RGB-triplet substitution over title.skin/tabs.skin
#   verify.sh  -> fails if a non-identity old hex or triplet survives
#
# Rules:
#   - identity pairs (old == new) are never substituted and never flagged
#   - tabs/tab_selected.svg gets a file-scoped extra pass in recolor.sh: its
#     mapped foreground (#c1c1c1) becomes the teal accent #5f8787, so the active
#     tab carries the accent like the panel indicator and the Kvantum highlight
#
# Gorgoroth ladder: 000000 bg · c1c1c1 foreground · 888888 mids · 505050 dim
# 8a4f4f negative · 6b3d3d negative hover · 5f8787 teal accent.

1e1e20 000000   # title + tab background
aaaaac c1c1c1   # text (title.skin/tabs.skin: 170,170,172 -> 193,193,193)
ffffff c1c1c1   # glyphs and tab borders (tab_selected gets teal instead)
6e6e70 888888   # mid gray
666666 888888   # mid gray (logo)
4f4f4f 505050   # dim (logo)
da4453 8a4f4f   # negative
da4452 8a4f4f   # negative
b43c48 6b3d3d   # negative hover (keeps the press feedback distinct)
000000 000000   # identity: pure black
